From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: TheDBP <TheDBP@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 5 Oct 2026 13:19:40 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] msm8996-common: Ims4 rework -- collision-renamed bundled
 libs, smali fixups, verify stubs

build-ims4.sh: bundle libdiag/libssl/libcrypto/libjpeg too (libqmi needs libdiag; the 2016 libssl
pair must stay matched), rename any bundled lib whose name also exists in /system/lib to a private
*_lgeims.so soname and rewrite the bundled DT_NEEDEDs (the app namespace otherwise finds the newer,
incompatible system copy first), store lib/ uncompressed, and run smali-fixups.py after the method
redirects. New verify stubs under extra-smali (LG framework classes absent on 24.0, incl.
com.android.lge.lgsvcitems.LgSvcCmd -- '' matches the app's own null fallback) and more redirects.
